what is used:
- tasks.py: TASKS entries safe-path, sql-user, csv-sum, cache, reuse-slug, trace-transfer
  (prompt, seed, good, bad, axis, score). The other entries are present but not wired
  (todo-null needs node at score time; the tmpl-* tier needs a cloned template repo).
  Not modified. Loaded by run.py through importlib, never by `import tasks`.
- loc.js: the LOC oracle. run.py --selftest runs it under node over the 22 Without/With
  sections of the examples and requires the Python port to agree 22/22. It is not used to
  score a cell: the cell metric is `git diff --cached --numstat HEAD` (see ../../protocol.md).

